@felan-ai/ext-rtk-optimizer

Includes code and behavior adapted from pi-rtk-optimizer 0.9.0,
https://github.com/MasuRii/pi-rtk-optimizer at source commit
d155d253cb2f1358e34e717d47a82ebccb08cb8e.

Copyright (c) 2026 MasuRii
Licensed under the MIT License included in this package.

Adapted portions include RTK rewrite delegation, runtime availability guards,
tool-output compaction techniques, read-compaction safeguards, configuration,
session metrics, and the /rtk command behavior. Felan routes I/O through
AgentRuntime and adds native support for Codex exec_command and write_stdin
tools while preserving their structured result envelopes.
